OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor calls for new estate to
OL,4,Abe named after Sir Ken Dodd
OL,5,
OL,6,FA councillor has written to a housing
OL,7,Fdeveloper to request that a number of
OL,8,Froads on a new estate in Knotty Ash be
OL,9,Fnamed in honour of comedian Sir Ken
OL,10,FDodd.
OL,12,FHarry Doyle, who represents the Knotty
OL,13,FAsh and Dovecot Park ward on Liverpool
OL,14,FCity Council, said Knotty Ash was
OL,15,F"synonymous with Sir Ken Dodd" and is
OL,16,Fbacking calls for a "lasting legacy" in
OL,17,Fthe comic's hometown.
OL,19,FSir Ken's close friend John Martin has
OL,20,Flaunched a petition requesting that the
OL,21,Fcouncil considers honouring him in this
OL,22,Fway.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
